  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Built on DuckDB v1.5.6\n\nNew features:\n- DuckDBHugeInt.ToInt128 and DuckDBUHugeInt.ToUInt128\n- Equality without boxing for DuckDBDateOnly, DuckDBTimeOnly, DuckDBTimestamp, DuckDBInterval and DuckDBTimeTz (IEquatable<T>)\n- Bindings for duckdb_scalar_function_set_bind_data_copy and duckdb_unsafe_vector_assign_string_element_len\n\nPerformance:\n- Creating a DuckDBHugeInt or DuckDBUHugeInt from a BigInteger is faster and no longer allocates\n\nFixes:\n- DuckDBInterval reads and writes negative days and microseconds\n- DuckDBHugeInt accepts -2^127, and its limits no longer fail under cultures with another minus sign",
